ty via training, and note that no other candidate matches A's combination of reliability, stress resilience, decision quality, technical competence, and crew atmosphere.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: \"I concur with the panel's shift to Candidate A...\". Then METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate A.\n\nMake sure format exactly:\n\nPUBLIC_MESSAGE:\n<text>\n\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_1\", \"vote\": \"Candidate A\"}\n\nProceed."}
